A||||3||Kwez||struts for 88GTs ?? (pls hlp kwick)||||1||
Z||000000||Kwez||08-30-2001||12:51 PM||||Hi,<BR>I was planning to get KYB gr2 struts & KYB gasadjust shocks for my 88GT, but when I called the shop I was told there are no gr2 struts for the 88 ! (they actually didn't have any struts for the 88 !)<P>what are my options for the struts ?<BR>I'm getting the kyb gasadjust for the front...<P>I'm also opened to comments / suggestions (ie: "get something else than gasadjust if you get xyz struts etc...)<P>I know I'm at the last minute, but I was hoping to have them for a week-end install (3 day week-end here in Quebec)<P>thank you very much<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000001||mrfiero||08-30-2001||01:06 PM||||This has been covered before.......buy the KYB GR-2 struts for an '87 Fiero and you'll be OK.<P>The only issue is some (not all) '88 Fieros need to have the slots on the strut and/or the spindle elongated to get the aligment correct.  This usually occurs on the right rear strut/spindle.  Again, not all '88s hve this problem.....only some.<P>I have had KYB struts on several of my '88s over the years, so it will work.<P>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Kwez||08-30-2001||01:10 PM||||ok, thank you very much i appreciate it.<BR>sorry i didn't do a search, but i'm at work & really can't take the time to do that right now .. & couldn't wait for an answer either ;-)<P>thx again||||reg||1
Z||000003||mrfiero||08-30-2001||01:21 PM||||Glad I could help.   Sorry if I sounded harsh on the "this has been covered before".....I didn't mean anything by it, other than it had been discussed before.<P>Are you doing it yourself or having a sop install them?  If a shop is installing them make sure you tell them about the potential problem with the right rear.<P>Years ago (while installing my first set of KYBs) I brought it to Sears for an alignment and they had to elongate the hole.....they charged me $20, but that was reasonable.<P>The next 2 or 3 times (on different '88s) I had no problems at all......that's why I say you may not even have to elongate the hole at all.<P>  ||||reg||1
